  "description": "Merged 10 ibm security advisories published on 2026-08-24. Original advisory IDs: IBM-7284670, IBM-7284837, IBM-7284851, IBM-7284637, IBM-7282646, IBM-7284733, IBM-7282648, IBM-7284501, IBM-7284498, IBM-7284806\n\nTitles:\n- IBM QRadar Suite Software includes components with multiple known vulnerabilities\n- IBM Watson Speech Services Cartridge is vulnerable to multiple issues in logback-core [CVE-2026-10532, CVE-2026-9828]\n- IBM Watson Speech Services Cartridge is vulnerable to multiple Base OS issues\n- Vulnerabilities found in Watson Data Intelligence\n- Langflow OSS is affected by arbitrary code execution in component generation, validation, and custom component handling\n- Langflow is affected by multiple remote code execution vulnerabilities due to insufficient code-execution policy enforcement\n- Langflow is affected by weaknesses in secret handling and sensitive configuration access\n- IBM Storage Fusion Data Foundation is vulnerable to Denial of Service.\n- IBM Storage Fusion Data Foundation is vulnerable to Security Bypass\n- Due to the use of WebSphere Application Server Liberty, IBM Tivoli Application Dependency Discovery Manager is affected by multiple vulnerabilities",
